This page explains the demo environment and its experience accounts. It is for pre-sales staff who present Operon and for prospects who try Operon themselves.

The demo environment is a separate copy of Operon at [demo.operoncore.app](https://demo.operoncore.app). It runs the same version of Operon as the live service, but it holds only fictional data. You can try every main line of work there, and you can return an account to its starting state at any time.

## Experience accounts

An experience account is a demo firm for one person: a pre-sales colleague or a prospect. Each account is a complete firm with its own staff, clients, cases, invoices and books. What you change in one account does not show in any other account.

### Get an account

A platform administrator of the demo environment opens the account under **Experience accounts** in the platform console. The administrator chooses:

| Field | Meaning |
|---|---|
| **Name** | The name of the account, for example the person who uses it. |
| **For** | Optional: who will use the account. |
| **Sign-in prefix** | Lower-case letters, digits and hyphens. All sign-in addresses of the account start with it. |
| **Last day** | The last day the account can be used. An account for a pre-sales colleague can have no last day. |

When the account is opened, the console shows the **Administrator email** and the **Password** once. The administrator sends them to you. All roles of the account use the same password.

### Sign in

Open [demo.operoncore.app](https://demo.operoncore.app) and sign in with one of the addresses below. `<prefix>` is the sign-in prefix of your account.

| Sign-in address | Person | Role | Use it to show |
|---|---|---|---|
| `<prefix>.admin@demo.operoncore.app` | Evelyn Tan Shu Ying, Managing Director | Tenant admin | Approvals, invoices, settings, the demo inbox and the reset. |
| `<prefix>.secretarial-manager@demo.operoncore.app` | Marcus Goh Wei Jie, Head of Corporate Secretarial | Manager | Reviews of annual returns and corporate changes. |
| `<prefix>.secretary@demo.operoncore.app` | Priya Raman, Corporate Secretarial Executive | Member | Annual returns, incorporations and changes. |
| `<prefix>.accounting-manager@demo.operoncore.app` | Daniel Ong Kah Wai, Head of Accounting | Manager | Reviews of the books and GST returns; client messages. |
| `<prefix>.accountant@demo.operoncore.app` | Nur Aisyah Rahman, Accountant | Member | The bookkeeping workbench and one-click fill. |
| `<prefix>.sales@demo.operoncore.app` | Ryan Chua Jun Hao, Business Development Manager | Manager | Opportunities, contracts and the client checklist. |

A seventh address, `<prefix>.client@demo.operoncore.app`, belongs to Rachel Lau Pei Qi, the finance contact of the client Marigold Lane Kitchen. It signs in to the client portal, not to the firm's side. See [Client portal](/en/demo/client-portal/).

The sign-in page and the home page show the notice **This is a demo environment. Do not upload real documents or personal data.**

